Run F prime deployment and GDS

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

Communications options:
  --output-unframed-data [OUTPUT_UNFRAMED_DATA]
                        Log unframed data to supplied file relative to log
                        directory. Use '-' for standard out. (default: None)

Dictionary options:
  -d DEPLOYMENT, --deployment DEPLOYMENT
                        Deployment installation/build output directory.
                        [default: install_dest field in settings.ini]
                        (default: None)
  --dictionary DICTIONARY
                        Path to dictionary. Overrides automatic dictionary
                        detection. (default: None)
  --packet-spec PACKET_SPEC
                        Path to packet XML specification (should not be used
                        if JSON packet definitions are used). (default: None)
  --packet-set-name PACKET_SET_NAME
                        Name of packet set defined in the JSON dictionary.
                        (default: None)

FPrime binary options:
  -n, --no-app          Do not run deployment binary. Overrides --app.
                        (default: False)
  --app APP             Path to app to run. Overrides automatic app detection.
                        (default: None)

File handling options:
  --file-storage-directory FILES_STORAGE_DIRECTORY
                        Directory to store uplink and downlink files. Default:
                        /tmp/root
  --remote-sequence-directory REMOTE_SEQUENCE_DIRECTORY
                        Directory to save command sequence binaries, on the
                        remote FSW. Default: /seq
  --file-uplink-cooldown FILE_UPLINK_COOLDOWN
                        Cooldown period between file uplink packets. Default:
                        0 S
  --file-uplink-chunk-size FILE_UPLINK_CHUNK_SIZE
                        Size of the data payload for a file uplink. Default:
                        256

GUI options:
  -g {none,html}, --gui {none,html}
                        Set the desired GUI system for running the deployment.
                        [default: html]
  --gui-addr GUI_ADDR   Set the GUI server address [default: 127.0.0.1]
  --gui-port GUI_PORT   Set the GUI server address [default: 5000]

Hash file options:
  --hash-file HASH_FILE
                        Path to hashes.txt file map (found under build-
                        artifacts dir by default) (default: None)

Logging options:
  -l LOGS, --logs LOGS  Logging directory. Created if non-existent. [default:
                        /home/xilinx/wepwawet-core/fprime/core-
                        source/WepwawetDeployment/logs]
  --log-directly        Logging directory is used directly, no extra dated
                        directories created. (default: False)
  --log-to-stdout       Log to standard out along with log output files
                        (default: False)
  --log-level-gds {DEBUG,INFO,WARNING,ERROR}
                        Set the logging level of GDS processes [default: INFO]
  --disable-data-logging
                        Disable logging of each data item (default: False)

Middleware options:
  --no-zmq              Disable ZMQ transportation layer, falling back to TCP
                        socket server. (default: True)
  --zmq-transport serverInUrl serverOutUrl
                        Pair of URls used with --zmq to setup ZeroMQ
                        transportation [default: ['ipc:///tmp/fprime-server-
                        in', 'ipc:///tmp/fprime-server-out']]
  --tts-port TTS_PORT   Set the threaded TCP socket server port when ZMQ is
                        not used [default: 50050]
  --tts-addr TTS_ADDR   Set the threaded TCP socket server address when ZMQ is
                        not used [default: 0.0.0.0]

Framing Plugin Options:
  --framing-selection {space-packet-space-data-link,fprime}
                        Select framing implementer. (default: space-packet-
                        space-data-link)

Framing Plugin 'space-packet-space-data-link' Options:
  --scid SCID           Spacecraft ID (if specified, overrides dictionary
                        ComCfg value) (default: None)
  --vcid VCID           Virtual channel ID (default: 1)
  --frame-size FRAME_SIZE
                        Fixed Size of TM Frames (if specified, overrides
                        dictionary ComCfg value) (default: None)

Communication Plugin Options:
  --communication-selection {uart,ip,none}
                        Select communication implementer. (default: ip)

Communication Plugin 'uart' Options:
  --uart-device DEVICE  UART device representing the FSW. (default:
                        /dev/ttyACM0)
  --uart-baud BAUD      Baud rate of the serial device. (default: 9600)
  --uart-skip-port-check
                        Skip checking that the port exists (default: False)

Communication Plugin 'ip' Options:
  --ip-address ADDRESS  Address of the IP adapter server. (default: 0.0.0.0)
  --ip-port PORT        Port of the IP adapter server. (default: 50000)
  --ip-client           Run the IP adapter as the client (connects to FSW
                        running TcpServer) (default: True)
  --keepalive-interval KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL
                        Keep alive packet interval. 0.0 = off, default = 0.5
                        (default: 0.5)

Gds_App Plugin 'custom-data-handlers-app' Options:
  --disable-custom-data-handlers-app
                        Disable the gds_app plugin 'custom-data-handlers-app'
                        (default: False)
